/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The tourism industry is evolving, but traditional methods of exploration, such as guidebooks or static maps, fail to capture the curiosity of modern travelers. There is a need for an innovative solution that motivates exploration and creates a rich, immersive experience for tourists while encouraging them to uncover hidden gems and connect with local culture. This will be beneficial for every sector of the country.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
